 ('In which surah does the account of Harut and Marut occur?', 'Al-Baqara', ['Ya-Sin', 'Al-Kahf', 'An-Nur'], 'Harut and Marut are mentioned in al-Baqara 102 in the context of magic taught in Babylon.', 'Belief in angels'),
 ('According to ar-Ra‘d 11, who are the beings before and behind a person who guard him by God’s command?', 'Successive angels (mu‘aqqibat)', ['Jinn', 'Birds', 'Winds'], 'Ar-Ra‘d 11 mentions angels in succession guarding a person by God’s command.', 'Belief in angels'),
